# Esc-Esc on an empty, idle input opens the Rewind dialog; Esc again
# cancels with no change (dialog_rewind.go's HandleKey "esc" case returns
# closeIt=true with no onSelect call, so Outcome leaves nothing behind).
@faux testdata/faux/qa/dialogs-rewind.yaml

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE run this shell command and report its output: echo turn-one
KEY enter
WAITFOR /First turn reply from kiln/ 20
SHOT turn-one
TYPE run this shell command and report its output: echo turn-two
KEY enter
WAITFOR /Second turn reply from kiln/ 20
SHOT turn-two
KEY esc esc
WAITFOR /Go back in the conversation to before one of your messages/ 20
SHOT rewind-dialog-open
KEY up
SHOT rewind-navigated
KEY esc
WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT rewind-cancelled
EXPECT /First turn reply from kiln/
EXPECT /Second turn reply from kiln/
EXPECT_NOT /Rewound to before/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
